#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Audience Segmentation:</strong> Target specific groups—like VIP "
"members or recent joiners—for more personalized outreach."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການແບ່ງກຸ່ມຜູ້ຮັບ:</strong> ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍກຸ່ມສະເພາະ—ເຊັ່ນ: ສະມາຊິກ VIP ຫຼື "
"ຜູ້ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໃໝ່—ເພື່ອການສື່ສານທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະເພາະບຸກຄົນຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automate Your Renewals</strong><br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                Set up automatic reminders and renewal workflows in the "
"Subscription app to avoid missed payments and lapses in membership. Combine "
"it with automated email marketing to re-engage members who haven't renewed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕໍ່ອາຍຸແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong><br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ອາຍຸໃນແອັບ Subscription "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂາດການຊຳລະເງິນ ແລະ ສະມາຊິກໝົດອາຍຸ. "
"ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອດຶງດູດສະມາຊິກທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕໍ່ອາຍຸໃຫ້ກັບມາ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated Billing &amp; Invoicing:</strong> Reduce administrative "
"overhead by automating invoicing and payment reminders."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຮຽກເກັບເງິນ &amp; ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</strong> ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນວຽກງານບໍລິຫານ "
"ໂດຍການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ ແລະ ແຈ້ງເຕືອນການຊຳລະເງິນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Branded Products:</strong> Offer branded items like t-shirts, mugs, "
"or event tickets in your online shop."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສິນຄ້າຕິດແບຣນ:</strong> ວາງຂາຍສິນຄ້າຕິດແບຣນ ເຊັ່ນ: ເສື້ອຍືດ, ຈອກນ້ຳ, ຫຼື "
"ປີ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມງານ ໃນຮ້ານຄ້າອອນລາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Bundle Memberships with Exclusive Products or Events</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຮວມແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກກັບສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ງານກິດຈະກຳພິເສດສະເພາະ</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>CRM Integration:</strong> Capture new leads directly from event sign-"
"ups and follow up post-event."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ CRM:</strong> "
"ເກັບກຳລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ມີທ່າແຮງເປັນລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ໂດຍກົງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນງານ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມຜົນຫຼັງຈົບງານ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.homepage
msgid "<strong>Can you trust our community partners?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ທ່ານສາມາດໄວ້ວາງໃຈຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານຊຸມຊົນຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ບໍ່?</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Churn Reduction:</strong> Use metrics and automatic follow-ups to "
"reduce cancellations and boost renewals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການຍົກເລີກສະມາຊິກ:</strong> ໃຊ້ຕົວຊີ້ວັດ ແລະ ການຕິດຕາມອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ເພີ່ມອັດຕາການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Coupons &amp; Promotions:</strong> Launch exclusive offers and "
"campaigns to drive traffic and sales."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄູປອງ &amp; ໂປຣໂມຊັນ:</strong> ເປີດຕົວຂໍ້ສະເໜີພິເສດ ແລະ ແຄມເປນຕ່າງໆ "
"ເພື່ອກະຕຸ້ນຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມ ແລະ ຍອດຂາຍ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Email Campaigns:</strong> Announce new events, welcome new members, "
"or send newsletters with beautifully designed emails."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແຄມເປນອີເມວ:</strong> ປະກາດງານໃໝ່, ຕ້ອນຮັບສະມາຊິກໃໝ່, ຫຼື "
"ສົ່ງຈົດໝາຍຂ່າວດ້ວຍຮູບແບບອີເມວທີ່ອອກແບບຢ່າງສວຍງາມ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Event Management:</strong> Plan and manage seminars, galas, "
"tournaments, or online webinars with ease."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດການງານກິດຈະກຳ:</strong> ວາງແຜນ ແລະ ຈັດການສຳມະນາ, ງານລ້ຽງ, "
"ການແຂ່ງຂັນ, ຫຼື ເວບບິນາ (Webinar) ອອນລາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Event Pages:</strong> Automatically create sleek event pages with "
"schedules, speaker bios, and registration forms."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໜ້າເວັບງານກິດຈະກຳ:</strong> ສ້າງໜ້າເວັບງານທີ່ສວຍງາມໄດ້ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ພ້ອມຕາຕະລາງເວລາ, ປະຫວັດຜູ້ບັນຍາຍ, ແລະ ແບບຟອມລົງທະບຽນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Flexible Plans:</strong> Create different subscription models—"
"monthly, annual, family, student, etc."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແຜນທີ່ຢືດຢຸ່ນ:</strong> ສ້າງຮູບແບບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ—ລາຍເດືອນ, ລາຍປີ, "
"ຄອບຄົວ, ນັກຮຽນ-ນັກສຶກສາ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Follow-Ups and Reminders:</strong> Automate communications for "
"membership expirations, event invitations, and special announcements to keep "
"your community engaged."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ:</strong> "
"ສື່ສານແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງສະມາຊິກ, ຄຳເຊີນຮ່ວມງານ, ແລະ ປະກາດພິເສດຕ່າງໆ "
"ເພື່ອຮັກສາການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຂອງຊຸມຊົນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:members_club.event_event_1
msgid "<strong>Free for members | Guests €30</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຟຣີສຳລັບສະມາຊິກ | ແຂກທົ່ວໄປ €30</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.homepage
msgid "<strong>How is your privacy protected?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການປົກປ້ອງແນວໃດ?</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Integrated Contact Forms:</strong> Connect your forms directly to "
"your CRM pipeline to follow up with interest."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ແບບເຊື່ອມໂຍງ:</strong> ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຟອມຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າກັບຂະບວນການຂາຍຂອງ CRM "
"ໂດຍກົງ ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຜູ້ທີ່ສົນໃຈ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.homepage
msgid "<strong>Is the membership process straightforward?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຂັ້ນຕອນການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກງ່າຍດາຍບໍ່?</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Lead Management:</strong> Track incoming requests, categorize "
"potential members, and nurture them through a personalized onboarding "
"journey."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດການລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່:</strong> ຕິດຕາມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ, ແບ່ງກຸ່ມສະມາຊິກທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງ, "
"ແລະ ດູແລພວກເຂົາຜ່ານຂະບວນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Marketing Automation:</strong> Trigger actions based on user behavior"
"—for example, follow up with visitors who abandon their subscription cart."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບການຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</strong> ກະຕຸ້ນການດຳເນີນງານຕາມພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້—ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຕິດຕາມຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມທີ່ປະລະກະຕ່າສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Member Portal:</strong> Let members log in to view their "
"subscriptions, past orders, and upcoming events."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ພອດທັລສຳລັບສະມາຊິກ:</strong> ໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສະໝັກໃຊ້, "
"ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ຜ່ານມາ, ແລະ ງານທີ່ຈະມາເຖິງ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Membership Database:</strong> Manage your current members in one "
"place—view statuses, membership levels, renewal dates, and more."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສະມາຊິກ:</strong> ຈັດການສະມາຊິກປະຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໃນບ່ອນດຽວ—ເບິ່ງສະຖານະ, "
"ລະດັບສະມາຊິກ, ວັນທີຕໍ່ອາຍຸ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Memberships in the Shop:</strong> Sell memberships just like products"
"—visitors can sign up and pay online in minutes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຂາຍສະມາຊິກໃນຮ້ານຄ້າ:</strong> ຂາຍສະມາຊິກຄືກັນກັບສິນຄ້າ—ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມສາມາດສະໝັກ ແລະ "
"ຊຳລະເງິນອອນລາຍໄດ້ພາຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດນາທີ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<strong>Next up:</strong> Stay tuned for our <em>Silent Mornings</em> pilot "
"sessions launching in June—quiet co-working, guided journaling, and "
"intentional starts to the day."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລຳດັບຖັດໄປ:</strong> ຕິດຕາມກິດຈະກຳທົດລອງ <em>Silent Mornings</em> "
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນເດືອນມິຖຸນາ—ການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນຢ່າງງຽບສະຫງົບ, "
"ການຂຽນບັນທຶກແບບມີການແນະນຳ, ແລະ ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມື້ໃໝ່ຢ່າງມີສະຕິ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Opportunities &amp; Upsells:</strong> Identify and follow up on "
"upselling opportunities such as premium memberships or VIP event passes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂອກາດ &amp; ການຂາຍເພີ່ມ:</strong> ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໂອກາດການຂາຍເພີ່ມ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ສະມາຊິກລະດັບພຣີມຽມ ຫຼື ບັດຜ່ານງານລະດັບ VIP."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>SEO &amp; Analytics:</strong> Optimize visibility and track visitor "
"behavior to keep improving."
msgstr ""
"<strong>SEO &amp; ການວິເຄາະ:</strong> ປັບປຸງການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມ "
"ເພື່ອພັດທະນາຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:members_club.event_event_1
msgid "<strong>Schedule</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕາຕະລາງເວລາ</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Segment Your Community for Better Engagement</strong><br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                Use tags and filters in the <strong>CRM</strong> and "
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong> apps to segment your members based on "
"interests, membership tier, or activity. This lets you send targeted "
"campaigns and event invitations\n"
"                that feel personal."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແບ່ງກຸ່ມຊຸມຊົນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ</strong><br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                ໃຊ້ແທັກ (Tags) ແລະ ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງໃນແອັບ <strong>CRM</strong> ແລະ "
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong> ເພື່ອແບ່ງກຸ່ມສະມາຊິກຕາມຄວາມສົນໃຈ, ລະດັບສະມາຊິກ, ຫຼື "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສົ່ງແຄມເປນ ແລະ ຄຳເຊີນຮ່ວມງານທີ່ຕົງກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ\n"
"                ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກສະເພາະບຸກຄົນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Self-Service Portal:</strong> Let members manage their own accounts, "
"upgrade plans, or cancel via your website."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ພອດທັລບໍລິການຕົນເອງ:</strong> ໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກຈັດການບັນຊີຂອງຕົນເອງ, ອັບເກຣດແຜນ, ຫຼື "
"ຍົກເລີກຜ່ານທາງເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Social Media Dashboard:</strong> Schedule posts, track engagement, "
"and manage your platforms in one place."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໜ້າຄວບຄຸມສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍ:</strong> ຕັ້ງເວລາໂພສ, ຕິດຕາມການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ, ແລະ "
"ຈັດການທຸກແພລັດຟອມຂອງທ່ານໃນບ່ອນດຽວ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Ticketing System:</strong> Set up ticket tiers, early bird "
"discounts, and QR-code-based check-ins."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບປີ້:</strong> ກຳນົດລະດັບລາຄາປີ້, ສ່ວນຫຼຸດການຊື້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (Early Bird), ແລະ "
"ການເຊັກອິນດ້ວຍລະຫັດ QR."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Tips for success</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ເຄັດລັບສູ່ຄວາມສຳເລັດ</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Track Key Metrics in Real Time</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕິດຕາມຕົວຊີ້ວັດຫຼັກແບບສົດໆ (Real Time)</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Use the Sign App for Smooth Onboarding</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ໃຊ້ແອັບ Sign ເພື່ອການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Website Builder:</strong> Easily build pages for your club’s "
"mission, events, blog, or gallery."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເຄື່ອງມືສ້າງເວັບໄຊ:</strong> ສ້າງໜ້າເວັບສຳລັບພັນທະກິດ, ກິດຈະກຳ, ບລັອກ, ຫຼື "
"ຄັງຮູບພາບຂອງສະໂມສອນໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.homepage
msgid "<strong>What benefits do we provide?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ພວກເຮົາໃຫ້ຜົນປະໂຫຍດຫຍັງແດ່?</strong>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.homepage
msgid "<strong>What makes us unique?</strong>"
