#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid "woman in white tank top and black leggings doing yoga during daytime"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຍິງໃສ່ເສື້ອກ້າມສີຂາວ ແລະ ໂສ້ງເລກກິ້ງສີດຳ ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນໂຍຄະໃນຕອນກາງເວັນ"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"“I came because I was curious. I left with a new perspective—and three great "
"book recommendations,” said <strong>Marc T.</strong>, a longtime member."
msgstr ""
"“ຂ້ອຍມາເພາະຄວາມຢາກຮູ້. ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍກັບໄປພ້ອມກັບມຸມມອງໃໝ່ໆ—ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳປຶ້ມດີໆອີກສາມຫົວ,” "
"<strong>Marc T.</strong>, ສະມາຊິກເກົ່າແກ່ກ່າວ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"“I didn’t expect to feel such a shift after only a few breaths,” said member "
"<strong>Sophie L.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"“ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຄິດເລີຍວ່າຈະຮູ້ສຶກເຖິງຄວາມປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຫຼາຍປານນີ້ ພຽງແຕ່ຫາຍໃຈບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດຄັ້ງ,” ສະມາຊິກ "
"<strong>Sophie L.</strong> ກ່າວ"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"“It was like someone turned the volume down on my brain. I walked out "
"feeling 10 pounds lighter.”"
msgstr ""
"“ມັນຄືກັບມີຄົນມາຫຼຸດສຽງໃນສະໝອງຂອງຂ້ອຍລົງ. "
"ຂ້ອຍຍ່າງອອກມາດ້ວຍຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກເບົາສະບາຍຄືກັບນ້ຳໜັກຫຼຸດລົງໄປຫຼາຍ.”"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"“There was something healing about seeing other people wrestle with the same "
"things I do,” added <strong>Elena M.</strong> “It made me feel less alone.”"
msgstr ""
"“ມັນເປັນການປິ່ນປົວຈິດໃຈທີ່ດີ ເມື່ອໄດ້ເຫັນຄົນອື່ນກຳລັງຕໍ່ສູ້ກັບບັນຫາດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຂ້ອຍພົບເຈີ,” <strong>Elena "
"M.</strong> ກ່າວຕື່ມ. “ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ສຶກວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ຄົນດຽວ.”"

